# --- Secrets & credentials -----------------------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/credentials*
**/secret*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# --- OS / editor noise ---------------------------------------------------
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- Dependencies / build artefacts --------------------------------------
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# --- Local AI-tooling configuration (per-developer, not for the repo) ----
.claude/
.cline/
.clinerules/
.cursor/
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Symlinks to docs/base-standards.md (would be broken without docs/) --
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
codex.md

